package <https://www.dolfin.fr/showcase/city-transit/network>:
  dolfin_version "1"
  version "2.1.0"
  author "Dolfin"
  description "Réseau Lumière (fictional), infrastructure side: the stops of a mid-size French city's tram and bus network, its five lines with their ordered stops, walking connections between stops and step-free access. Imported by the timetable package."
